WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.441 --> 00:00:04.664
Unit twenty-two. Understanding Online Ads!

2
00:00:05.577 --> 00:00:11.174
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:11.224 --> 00:00:15.551
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:15.601 --> 00:00:20.044
Today we learn about Understanding Online Ads. Let's go!

5
00:00:20.777 --> 00:00:25.377
Advertisement. Say it with me. Advertisement!

6
00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:32.795
Sponsored. Say it with me. Sponsored!

7
00:00:36.354 --> 00:00:41.054
Influencer. Say it with me. Influencer!

8
00:00:44.499 --> 00:00:48.266
Product. Say it with me. Product!

9
00:00:51.799 --> 00:00:55.266
Buy. Say it with me. Buy!

10
00:00:58.754 --> 00:01:02.121
Data. Say it with me. Data!

11
00:01:05.608 --> 00:01:09.264
Target. Say it with me. Target!

12
00:01:12.778 --> 00:01:16.219
Think. Say it with me. Think!

13
00:01:19.749 --> 00:01:32.766
An advertisement tries to make you buy a product. Some posts are sponsored, and an influencer may be paid to show a product. Apps use your data to target ads, so I think before I buy.

14
00:01:32.816 --> 00:01:35.822
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:36.556 --> 00:01:42.086
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:42.136 --> 00:01:43.492
Influencer!

17
00:01:44.727 --> 00:01:50.314
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:50.364 --> 00:01:51.514
Target!

19
00:01:52.454 --> 00:01:59.059
Did you know? Influencers in many countries must say when a post is paid advertising!

20
00:01:59.109 --> 00:02:01.610
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:02.539 --> 00:02:11.346
Think and answer. How can you tell if a post is an advertisement?

22
00:02:11.396 --> 00:02:12.546
Great answer!

23
00:02:13.443 --> 00:02:18.538
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:18.588 --> 00:02:22.026
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

